  <p id="c-songshu-097-hu-tan-hezhi:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">初，<persName id="c-songshu-097-hu-tan-hezhi:p001:m0002" ref="v9j_1fp_kma_A">檀和之</persName>被徵至豫章，值豫章民<persName id="c-songshu-097-hu-tan-hezhi:p001:m0015" ref="otw_1ui_wba_C">胡誕世</persName>等反，因討平之，并論林邑功，封雲杜縣子，食邑四百戶。<persName id="c-songshu-097-hu-tan-hezhi:p001:m0044" ref="v9j_1fp_kma_A">和之</persName>，高平金鄉人，<persName id="c-songshu-097-hu-tan-hezhi:p001:m0053" ref="v9j_1fp_kma">檀憑</persName>子也。</p>
</text>
